description	"Freedon Nadd

Ancient Dark Lord of the Sith and King of Onderon, wielding ancient dark side sorcery, his personal dual-phase lightsaber, and a sidearm.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Freedon Nadd's Sword 
-- Shoto And Sith Sword (Dual/Purple/Cyan)
-- Sith Sword (Red/Purple/Cyan)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (2)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Cripples/Poisons On Hit
- Ancient Blaster Pistol (1) 
-- 30% More Damage/FP Drain, 60% More Velocity
-- 150% Slower RoF, Mag Reload

^3Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Sense (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Lightning (2)
- Drain (2)
- Grip (3) ^3[CS3]
- Absorb (1) ^3[CS2]

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Gun Defense (2) & Deflect (2)
- Blast Armor
- Environmental Protection (1)
- Darks Beacon"